---
---

<section id="stage-instructions" class="stage-card" style="display: none;" aria-labelledby="instr-title">
  <div class="card-header">
    <div class="step-badge">Langkah 4 dari 4: Panduan Kuis</div>
    <h1 id="instr-title" class="title-display">Aturan Permainan</h1>
    <p class="subtitle-text">
      Uji ketajaman ingatan dan fokus Anda seputar kekayaan Nusantara serta dedikasi Surya Nusantara.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rules-list">
    <div class="rule-item">
      <div class="rule-num">1</div>
      <div class="rule-content">
        <h2 class="rule-heading">10 Pertanyaan Pilihan Ganda</h2>
        <p class="rule-desc">7 soal umum warisan &amp; keahlian Nusantara, dan 3 soal seputar kampanye Surya Nusantara.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rule-item">
      <div class="rule-num">2</div>
      <div class="rule-content">
        <h2 class="rule-heading">3 Detik Waktu Membaca</h2>
        <p class="rule-desc">Diberikan jeda persiapan 3 detik sebelum penghitungan waktu menjawab dimulai.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rule-item">
      <div class="rule-num">3</div>
      <div class="rule-content">
        <h2 class="rule-heading">10 Detik Waktu Menjawab</h2>
        <p class="rule-desc">Pilihlah 1 jawaban yang paling tepat. Pilihan langsung terkunci setelah ditekan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rule-item">
      <div class="rule-num">4</div>
      <div class="rule-content">
        <h2 class="rule-heading">Penghitungan Skor (Maks. 100 Poin)</h2>
        <p class="rule-desc">Jawaban benar mendapat poin sesuai detik menjawab (1–10 poin). Jawaban salah atau waktu habis bernilai 0 poin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button id="btn-start-quiz" class="btn-primary" type="button">
    <span>Mulai Kuis Sekarang</span>
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
    </svg>
  </button>
</section>

<style>
  .stage-card {
    background: rgba(40, 23, 15, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196, 154, 69, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  .step-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-gold-300);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .title-display {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-gold-300);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .subtitle-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-cream-100);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .rules-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .rule-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    background: rgba(56, 32, 20, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196, 154, 69, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-input);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .rule-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--color-gold-500);
    color: var(--color-brown-950);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .rule-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .rule-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-cream-50);
  }

  .rule-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-cream-100);
    line-height: 1.35;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-gold-500) 0%, #a87e2b 100%);
    color: var(--color-brown-950);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .btn-primary:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>
